//! The documentation generator: `docs/generated/` (ADR-0051).
//!
//! The declared layout is `README.md`, `relations/<ns>.md`, `enums.md`,
//! `extension_types.md`, `passes.md`, `rules.md` and `schema/authoring.schema.json`, each
//! carrying the `<!-- @generated by pse-schema; do not edit -->` marker.
//!
//! Generated prose is a projection of the registry, never a second description of it: a
//! hand-edited table under `docs/generated/` is a red `codegen --check` diff, not a fix.
